{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":486723,"name":"Charles Roe","username":"Charles_Roe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/edb3f5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T17:57:46.446Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCursor for iOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen I open the app, it says connecting to computer but never loads.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDownload Grok Bot for iOS\u003cbr\u003e\nTry to launch Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt should connect and load all my bots.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"video-placeholder-container\" data-video-src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/e/3/e3c25299cf0ed679fa62096870e9ed08547de8d7.mp4\"\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eiOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.6.0 (8025)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486723-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486723-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T13:43:24.837Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":46.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171078,"topic_slug":"can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app","display_username":"Charles Roe","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136852,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app/171078/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":486766,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T18:29:51.535Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the report. It’s not your phone, your network, or your settings. Your Grok Bot computer can’t finish loading its saved data right now, and that’s why the app gets stuck on “connecting to computer”. This is an issue we’re tracking on our side, and I’ve already passed it to the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou don’t need to do anything in the app right now. Reinstall, Recover, or Reset won’t change anything.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne thing that could help us debug faster: did you recently save any large files (like videos) on the bot computer? If they’re not important, let me know. That might speed up the recovery.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ll reply here as soon as the computer is back up.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T18:29:51.535Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":1.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171078,"topic_slug":"can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app/171078/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":486776,"name":"Charles Roe","username":"Charles_Roe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/edb3f5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T18:45:13.775Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks Dean.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes — any videos on that computer can be deleted. They’re not needed and I don’t need them recovered.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStill stuck on iOS as of 18:59 BST. The app sits on “Connecting to your computer…” for a while, then drops to “Something went wrong” with Try Again. Force-quit, Wi-Fi/mobile data switch, and Try Again don’t get past it. No Recover button has appeared.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eiOS only on this account — Grok Bot 1.6.0 (8025). Happy for you to clear those files / finish the load from your side.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T19:03:11.854Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":1.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171078,"topic_slug":"can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app","display_username":"Charles Roe","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136852,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app/171078/9","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":487245,"name":"Charles Roe","username":"Charles_Roe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/edb3f5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T10:58:00.251Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Dean — just checking in.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStill the same this morning (9 Sep, 11:57 BST). iOS Grok Bot 1.6.0 (8025) sits on “Connecting to your computer…”, then “Something went wrong / Try Again”. No Recover button. Videos on that computer can still be deleted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHappy to wait on your side — is there an ETA, or anything else you need from me?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T10:58:00.251Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171078,"topic_slug":"can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app","display_username":"Charles Roe","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136852,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app/171078/10","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":487519,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T15:33:25.028Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/charles_roe\"\u003e@Charles_Roe\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve spent some time looking into this, and here’s what I found: your Grok Bot computer is getting stuck during the data restore. It’s holding a very large amount of data (roughly 125 GB, including some large video files in its workspace), and the restore runs out of space before the last few files finish. As a result, the app never gets past “Connecting to your computer…”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnfortunately, we aren’t able to surgically remove individual files from the computer. In the short term, until our engineers can dig into the problem, the only option available to us is a hard reset, but that would mean losing your existing bots. You mentioned that videos on the computer can be deleted, what about the existing bots?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":12,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T15:33:25.028Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":11.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171078,"topic_slug":"can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app/171078/12","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":487704,"name":"Charles Roe","username":"Charles_Roe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/edb3f5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T21:42:48.194Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Colin — thanks for looking.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVideos can be deleted. I want to keep the existing bots, so please don’t do the hard reset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHappy to wait until the engineers can free the space / finish the restore without wiping them. Let me know if you need anything else from me.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":14,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T21:42:48.194Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":12,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171078,"topic_slug":"can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app","display_username":"Charles Roe","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":87436,"username":"Colin","name":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136852,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-t-use-grok-bot-ios-app/171078/14","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[486723,486766,486776,487245,487519,487704]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1],[5,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":408,"name":"networking","slug":"networking"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Can’t use Grok Bot iOS App","id":171078,"title":"Can’t use Grok Bot iOS App","posts_count":6,"created_at":"2026-09-08T17:57:46.